, so the leg is recorded as measured zero at line 544. This inflates `knownCount`. The reservation can also be released without setting the unknown-usage stop, so admission can continue while spend is unknown.\n\nAdd a per-leg flag to the report. Set it in `account()` when `result.usageProvenance !== 'measured'`, and declare it on the report type near `address.ts:197`. In `addressMany.ts`, treat the leg as known only when that flag is clear. A measured subtotal combined with an unmeasured dispatch must also settle as unknown.","id":"5ba86b41955253f71e54da0eee8afed3ac80bebbc3ea46843849c3e727f9b13b","intervals":[[534,534]],"path":"src/ops/review/addressMany.ts","severity":"major","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Treat a leg with unmeasured dispatches as unknown usage."}],"head":"a0a2d5be0296bb13a7fb0b4d4ae2d95be4baa6ed","head_tree":"59a8e4bccb16679adcf515ad27331e6995a154f0","input_scope":[{"blob":"cf250b12b1672dc3fe719f35e66ec9330ee7ade0","intervals":[[1,690]],"path":"src/ops/review/addressMany.ts"}],"job_id":"1c0119e95a4631eba0c58145fb825783ac1e4be44eeaa96c6d2577e100bf334d:0","outcome":"completed","paths":[{"baseline":{"method":"projection","reason":"path cluster"},"blob":"cf250b12b1672dc3fe719f35e66ec9330ee7ade0","disposition":"included","mode":"100644","path":"src/ops/review/addressMany.ts","reason":"bounded verified input"}],"policy_digest":"eacd1bcf42a0e72eca72fcf9c1e9c8f97e7c515cd67a8fa7965c966924647693","repo":"camerontaylor/cq-toolkit","requested_scope":[{"blob":"cf250b12b1672dc3fe719f35e66ec9330ee7ade0","intervals":[[41,41],[236,236],[249,249],[322,322],[382,382],[434,441],[468,469],[473,473],[480,480]],"path":"src/ops/review/addressMany.ts"}],"reviewed_scope":[{"blob":"cf250b12b1672dc3fe719f35e66ec9330ee7ade0","intervals":[[41,41],[236,236],[249,249],[322,322],[382,382],[434,441],[468,469],[473,473],[480,480]],"path":"src/ops/review/addressMany.ts"}],"scope_digest":"728c7cb2bf1b4cb189381a004b7d21054e7cf52636f4d15a9004ff75285f31e8","source":{"au